    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kivalwa cha Isakari",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wana wa Isakari ni bana nawo ni: Tola, Pua, Jashubu, na Shimroni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tola orekoghe na wana warandadu: Uzi, Refaia, Jerieli, Jahima; Ibsamu, na Shemueli, nawo niwo werekoghe wabaa wa kinyumba cha Tola. Ni wandu werekoghe mang'oni gha wuda. Matuku gha mzuri Daudi mtalo ghwawo ghorekoghe wandu elfu mirongo iwi na iwi na maghana arandadu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uzi odeeva mwana umweri, Izrahia. Wana wa Izrahia ni bana, Mikaeli, Obadia, Joeli, na Ishia; wose werekoghe wandu wabaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Werekoghe na waka wengi na wana wengi. Wikakaia na ijeshi ibaa kufumanya na kichuku cha mzawo, wandu elfu mirongo idadu na warandadu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mtalo ghwa wandu wa kichuku cha nyumba ya Isakari werekoghe elfu mrongo wunyanya na mfungade wiko mang'oni gha wuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kichuku cha Benjamini na Dani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Benjamini orekoghe na wana wadadu: Bela, Becheri, na Jadiaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bela orekoghe na wana wasanu: Ezboni Uzi, Uzieli, Jerimothi, na Iri. Werekoghe wabaa wa kinyumba cha kwawo, mang'oni gha wuda; wikaandikishwa kwa vichuku wandu elfu mirongo iwi na mirongo idadu na bana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Becheri orekoghe na wana ikenda: Zemira, Joashi, Eliezeri, Elioenai, Omri, Jeremothi, Abija, Anathothi na Alemethi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mtalo ghwa wandu wa kivalwa chawo mang'oni gha wuda; werekoghe wandu elfu mirongo iwi na maghana awi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jedieli odeeka na mwana umweri; Bilhani. Bilhani orekoghe na wana mfungade: Jerusha, Benjamini, Ehudi, Chenaana, Zethani, Tarshishi, na Ahishahari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awa wose werekoghe wabaa wa vinyumba vawo; mang'oni gha wuda. Mtalo ghwawo ghorekoghe wandu elfu ikumi na mfungade na maghana awi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shupimu na Hupimu werekoghe wana wa Iri, na Hushimu orekoghe mwana wa Dani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kivalwa cha Naftali",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naftali orekoghe na wana bana: Jahizeeli, Guni, Jezeri na Shalumu. (Werekoghe kivalwa cha Bilha.)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kivalwa cha Manase",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manase orekoghe na wana wawi uvailo ni muka Muaramu; Asirieli na Makiri. Makiri ndee ni Gileadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Makiri ukawilowora waka Hupimu na Shupimu. Mruna wa waka orewangwagha Maaka. Mruna wa kawi orewangwagha Selofehadi; Selofehadi odeeva wana wa waka waduu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao Maaka mka-Makiri ukava wana wawi: wikawiwanga Pereshi na Shereshi. Pereshi ukava wana wawi: Ulamu na Rakemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ulamu ukamva Bedani. Icho ni kivalwa cha Gileadi mwana wa Makiri wawae Manase.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gileadi mruna wa waka uwangwagha Hamolekethi orevaeghe wana wadadu: Ishihodi, Abiezeri, na Mahla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Shemida orekoghe na wana bana: Ahiani, Shekemu, Liki na Aniamu.)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kivalwa cha Efraimu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kivalwa cha Efraimu cherenughaneghe huwu: Shuthela, Beredi, Tahathi, Eleada, Tahathi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zabadi na Shuthela. Efraimu orekoghe na wana wamu wawi kula na Shuthela: Ezeri na Eleadi wana wa Efraimu werebwaghiloghe ni waisanga wa Gathi iji wereghendieghe kuiwa ng'ombe rawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndee Efraimu ukawililia matuku mengi na waruna wikacha kumhoresha ngolo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko Efraimu ukangia kwa mkake, nao ukapata kifu, ukava mwana, nao ukammbanga Beria; kwa wundu ghwa wasi wighupatire andenyi ya kinyumba chake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
