              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Efraimu orekoghe na mwai orewangwaghwa Sheera. Sheera ukaagha Beth-horoni ya Isi na ya Lughu, na Uzeni-sheera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Efraimu orekoghe na mwana wa womi orewangwagha Refa. Kivalwa chake chikanughana huwu: Refa, Tela, Tahani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ladani, Amihudi, Elishama, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuni, na Joshua.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Andu werekoghe wikikaia na mali rawo ni Betheli na mizi yaro, Naaramu cha mashariki, na Gezeri kukakaia cha magharibi chiaimweri na mizi yaro, wokoni wikachuria Shekemu na mizi yaro na Aya na mizi yaro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kichuku cha Manase cherewusireghe mizi ya Beth-sheani na mizi yaro, Taanaki na mizi yaro, Megido na mizi yaro na Dori na mizi yaro. Wana wa Josefu mwana wa Israeli, werekoghe wikikaia aho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kivalwa cha Asheri",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wana wa Asheri ni awa: Imna, Ishira, Isvi, Beria, na mruna wa waka Sera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wana wa Beria ni wawi: Heberi na Malkieli. (Malkieli nuo uzoe muzi ghwa Birzaithi.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Heberi orevivaeghe Jafuleti, Shomeri, Hothamu na mruna wa waka Shua. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wana wa Jafuleti ni wadadu: Pasaki, Bimhali, na Ashrathi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wana wa mruna Shemeri ni: Rohga, Jehuda, na Aramu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wana wa mruna Helemu ni: Sofa, Imna, Shelethi, na Amali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wana wa Sofa ni: Sua, Harneferi, Shuali, Beri, Ima, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bezeri, Hodi, Shamam Shilsha, Ithirani, na Beera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wana wa Jetheri ni: Jefune, Pispa, na Ara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wana wa Ula ni: Ara, Hanieli, na Risia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awa wose werekoghe kivalwa cha Asheri; wabaa wa kichuku chawo wikumikie kwa wuda. Mtalo ghwawo ghose seji wereandikiloghe werekoghe wandu elfu mirongo iwi na irandadu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
